  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></math> is the equation of the given parabola. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> is a point at a minimum distance from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#39;</mo></math>, then it should be normal to the parabola at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0110_6265f3c75d56.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 236px;\" /></p><p>Normal to parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></math> is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math><br /><br />It passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#160;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />Equation of circle with centre&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> and passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#39;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math> is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
